tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a> 的元语言有限可推导性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_0,\\psi_1\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\psi_0,\\psi_1\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta_0,\\theta_1\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left[\\left(T\\vdash(\\theta_0\\lor\\theta_1)\\right)\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}\\left(T\\vdash(\\psi_i\\to\\theta_i)\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\bigl((\\theta_0\\land\\theta_1)\\to(\\psi_0\\land\\psi_1)\\bigr)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta_0,\\theta_1\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left[\\left(T\\vdash(\\theta_0\\lor\\theta_1)\\right)\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}\\left(T\\vdash(\\psi_i\\to\\theta_i)\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\bigl((\\theta_0\\land\\theta_1)\\to(\\psi_0\\land\\psi_1)\\bigr)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>来源为印刷66页/PDF77页引理5。创建前检索本册全部文件及术语表，未有此句法分裂接口；它同时服务下游保守性判准与第7章约化原理，不同于已有解释度的格分裂定理。</p>\n<p>书面构造已对照图像：将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i\">\\(\\psi_i\\)</span> 正规化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\delta_i(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\delta_i(x)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i\\in\\Sigma_{n-1}\">\\(\\delta_i\\in\\Sigma_{n-1}\\)</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_i=\\forall x(\\neg\\delta_i(x)\\to\\exists y&lt;x+i\\,\\neg\\delta_{1-i}(y))\">\\(\\theta_i=\\forall x(\\neg\\delta_i(x)\\to\\exists y&lt;x+i\\,\\neg\\delta_{1-i}(y))\\)</span>。最小反例的先后次序使至少一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_i\">\\(\\theta_i\\)</span> 成立；同为真时不可能存在任何一侧最小反例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i\\to\\theta_i\">\\(\\psi_i\\to\\theta_i\\)</span> 直接成立。复杂度通过原书 Fact 5 正规化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>。这个正规化接口与 PA 内最小数论证没有在本原子另行机器重建，故保持证明资格限制。可推导性符号的辖域是其右侧整个公式；大合取联结的是元语言可推导性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致的固定原始递归算术公理呈示，$n\\ge1$；$\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n$ 及相对公式类取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 为算术句子集；$\\vdash$ 为 [[67-df-prim-provability]] 的元语言有限可推导性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L